# Public Static Hosting (Vercel / Netlify / Firebase Hosting):
# No environment API keys are required!
# Users enter their own free Gemini API Key inside the app's Settings ("সেটিংস ও API Key"),
# where it is stored locally in the user's browser localStorage.

